WEBVTT

00:01:41.230 --> 00:01:45.180
This plane will be landing shortly.

00:01:45.690 --> 00:01:47.290
Please fasten your seat belts.

00:01:47.810 --> 00:01:51.010
Please return your seats to their upright positions.

00:02:07.430 --> 00:02:12.230
Yuzuyu-chan... my mother is already dead...

00:02:15.020 --> 00:02:21.060
I think she wanted to watch over me much longer...

00:02:25.500 --> 00:02:31.050
I think all mothers think that way.

00:02:34.330 --> 00:02:35.070
It's okay.

00:02:35.870 --> 00:02:39.470
Your mother won't forget you.

00:02:41.570 --> 00:02:44.470
There's no way she can.

00:02:53.950 --> 00:02:54.360
Yeah.

00:03:09.010 --> 00:03:15.500
Kokoro-onee-chan... aren't you lonely without your mother?

00:03:18.110 --> 00:03:20.700
I'm fine... I'm already grown up.

00:03:28.810 --> 00:03:32.310
Does your loneliness go away when you grow up?

00:03:34.930 --> 00:03:37.050
When did your loneliness go away?

00:03:40.350 --> 00:03:41.230
You're right...

00:03:42.850 --> 00:03:47.070
Even when you grow up, there's no way your loneliness will go away...

00:03:49.900 --> 00:03:51.310
I'm just enduring it.

00:03:52.460 --> 00:03:58.650
When I try to endure it, I get sad and start crying.

00:04:00.920 --> 00:04:01.720
That's right.

00:04:03.590 --> 00:04:05.440
Kokoro-onee-chan,are you sad?

00:04:07.170 --> 00:04:07.610
Yes.

00:04:13.090 --> 00:04:16.010
But... I thought I'd live without running away from those sad feelings.

00:04:18.560 --> 00:04:22.810
I decided to stop lying to myself about not being lonely.

00:04:25.920 --> 00:04:30.460
And so... I feel like I've grown a little stronger.

00:04:37.860 --> 00:04:38.660
What's wrong?

00:04:39.450 --> 00:04:42.590
For some reason... I... feel sad...

00:04:47.480 --> 00:04:54.100
When thinking about how sad you must feel... It makes me sad, too!

00:05:01.800 --> 00:05:04.530
Sorry for making you worry.

00:05:07.990 --> 00:05:10.870
You've cried for me...

00:05:12.910 --> 00:05:13.680
Thank you.

00:05:14.530 --> 00:05:17.120
You're so nice, Yuzuyu-chan,

00:05:28.690 --> 00:05:29.790
I'm back.

00:05:30.580 --> 00:05:31.530
Welcome home!

00:05:33.320 --> 00:05:35.070
Sorry. I made her cry.

00:05:36.230 --> 00:05:38.110
What? Did you bully her?

00:05:38.220 --> 00:05:39.280
Are you kidding?

00:05:39.600 --> 00:05:41.710
I thought you might be fighting over me!

00:05:42.160 --> 00:05:45.050
Kippei's mine! GRRR!!

00:05:45.500 --> 00:05:46.320
...Like that!

00:05:46.860 --> 00:05:49.320
What are you thinking?

00:05:49.620 --> 00:05:52.230
Kippei-onii-chan... is an idiot.

00:05:53.600 --> 00:05:57.400
I'm starting to worry about you taking care of Yuzuyu-chan.

00:05:57.810 --> 00:06:01.310
Don't you have any feelings of loneliness, Kippei-onii-chan?

00:06:02.610 --> 00:06:04.850
There's no way he does.

00:06:05.500 --> 00:06:06.430
I see.

00:06:07.010 --> 00:06:08.210
What's with that?!

00:06:08.750 --> 00:06:11.230
Having an insider-only conversation...!

00:06:11.430 --> 00:06:12.260
Right?

00:06:12.770 --> 00:06:13.670
Right!

00:06:17.300 --> 00:06:18.550
What's wrong, Kokoro-chin?

00:06:26.790 --> 00:06:28.390
What're you doing?!

00:06:29.330 --> 00:06:30.570
Kippei's girlfriend!?

00:06:31.990 --> 00:06:32.510
Yeah.

00:06:33.050 --> 00:06:35.690
Tokunaga Kokoro... I call her Kokoro-chin.

00:06:36.310 --> 00:06:39.730
"Kokoro-chin"... Don't you have any other names?

00:06:39.890 --> 00:06:42.590
That's somehow... Not Japaneseish...

00:06:44.880 --> 00:06:46.430
Is my Kippei sexy?

00:06:48.150 --> 00:06:50.590
What're you babbling about?

00:06:51.320 --> 00:06:54.360
Kokoro-chin's being much less talkative than usual.

00:06:56.320 --> 00:07:00.360
We heard from Kippei... that you're living alone.

00:07:00.700 --> 00:07:03.210
If you get lonely, you can stop by anytime!

00:07:03.850 --> 00:07:04.810
Right, Dad?

00:07:08.680 --> 00:07:09.370
That's right!

00:07:09.770 --> 00:07:10.880
Why don't you stay here tonight?

00:07:12.740 --> 00:07:16.340
Yeah! Though there's nothing special, please stay!

00:07:18.760 --> 00:07:22.390
That Kippei would bring his girlfriend over...

00:07:23.200 --> 00:07:26.150
Satsuki-onii-chan has a girlfriend, too!

00:07:28.540 --> 00:07:31.330
Isn't Satsuki still in elementary school?

00:07:32.100 --> 00:07:34.720
Yuzuyu-chan, what are you saying?

00:07:35.980 --> 00:07:39.100
Could you be talking about... her?

00:07:39.970 --> 00:07:41.110
Mom, did you know?

00:07:42.660 --> 00:07:45.490
She's really tall and cute!

00:07:45.670 --> 00:07:46.580
My!

00:07:46.950 --> 00:07:50.090
Damn it! Why did you change the topic to Satsuki?!

00:08:21.920 --> 00:08:22.610
Yes?

00:08:29.920 --> 00:08:30.880
Miyako-san...

00:08:39.360 --> 00:08:42.610
You knew where I was right away?

00:08:47.750 --> 00:08:51.400
In the past... When I received the letter, I asked a friend and had them investigate it for me.

00:08:52.320 --> 00:08:55.740
The letter... Quite a lot of time has passed since then, eh?

00:08:57.030 --> 00:09:04.120
That's because I wanted to wait for you to come get Yuzuyu-chan yourself.

00:09:17.270 --> 00:09:18.960
You sleep in here together?

00:09:19.850 --> 00:09:20.380
Yep!

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:24.580
Kippei-onii-chan reads me stories!

00:09:27.530 --> 00:09:28.640
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:09:30.170 --> 00:09:31.380
Snacks!

00:09:33.170 --> 00:09:34.490
Sorry, Kokoro-chin...

00:09:35.050 --> 00:09:36.720
My family is quite annoying.

00:09:37.190 --> 00:09:39.360
Yes... Amusing, though.

00:09:41.650 --> 00:09:42.800
It's cocoa.

00:09:43.310 --> 00:09:44.740
Ah, that's right!

00:09:47.880 --> 00:09:49.830
Look, Yuzuyu!

00:09:51.840 --> 00:09:52.880
Tadah!

00:09:53.040 --> 00:09:54.470
I fixed it!

00:09:57.750 --> 00:09:59.480
Kippei did his best.

00:10:00.690 --> 00:10:01.470
Try 'em on!

00:10:02.380 --> 00:10:03.150
No...

00:10:04.640 --> 00:10:05.880
What's wrong? You wanna wear them, right?

00:10:09.190 --> 00:10:11.560
But... they're so small.

00:10:15.320 --> 00:10:17.780
Don't throw them away, though!

00:10:20.500 --> 00:10:21.320
I won't.

00:10:24.560 --> 00:10:25.970
I'll store them away safely.

00:10:27.210 --> 00:10:27.640
Okay!

00:10:38.490 --> 00:10:40.880
Do you not want to see Yuzuyu-chan?

00:10:44.070 --> 00:10:47.300
She's... getting bigger and bigger.

00:10:48.030 --> 00:10:51.610
The pajamas you made for her... are too small now.

00:10:54.640 --> 00:10:59.610
They're too small, and though they're tight, she still wants to wear them.

00:11:02.440 --> 00:11:07.230
If she was with you, you could just make her new ones...

00:11:07.570 --> 00:11:09.650
...but that's impossible for Yuzuyu-chan.

00:11:10.020 --> 00:11:15.260
At that time, we asked, "What can we say to help her?"

00:11:21.430 --> 00:11:22.740
An album?

00:11:23.090 --> 00:11:25.130
Yes... Yuzuyu-chan's.

00:11:25.920 --> 00:11:26.580
We have one.

00:11:27.860 --> 00:11:29.090
Let's see.

00:11:33.290 --> 00:11:33.950
This?

00:11:36.010 --> 00:11:37.090
It's mama!

00:11:37.660 --> 00:11:39.030
I showed it to you before, too...

00:11:39.520 --> 00:11:40.650
I forgot!

00:11:41.300 --> 00:11:42.680
I'm glad you have pictures...

00:11:48.860 --> 00:11:49.410
It's done.

00:11:51.090 --> 00:11:51.720
Here!

00:11:56.600 --> 00:11:58.080
Wear it like this.

00:11:58.430 --> 00:12:00.830
I can be with Mama all the time like this!

00:12:01.330 --> 00:12:03.580
You haven't forgotten your mother's face, right?

00:12:04.040 --> 00:12:05.170
I'm happy!

00:12:05.520 --> 00:12:06.540
Thanks!

00:12:06.970 --> 00:12:07.950
Isn't that nice, Yuzuyu?

00:12:08.770 --> 00:12:09.290
Yep!

00:12:10.100 --> 00:12:11.340
Yay!

00:12:12.100 --> 00:12:14.380
It's Mama! This is how she looks!

00:12:15.000 --> 00:12:16.850
Yay! It's Mama!

00:12:20.440 --> 00:12:28.130
When I could stop being a weakling, I wanted to go get Yuzuyu...

00:12:29.950 --> 00:12:34.330
But... no matter how much time passes, nothing changes...

00:12:35.240 --> 00:12:40.240
The fact that time keeps passing... scares me...

00:12:43.430 --> 00:12:49.040
I feel that during this time, Yuzuyu might have forgotten about me...

00:12:50.120 --> 00:12:54.820
...and it makes me sad... and I start crying uncontrollably.

00:12:58.190 --> 00:13:00.520
Do you not want to see Yuzuyu-chan?

00:13:01.280 --> 00:13:02.090
I want to!

00:13:02.890 --> 00:13:07.130
I want to very much!

00:13:25.180 --> 00:13:27.320
Yuzuyu-chan, come here.

00:13:28.570 --> 00:13:31.070
What is it, Kokoro-onee-chan?

00:13:32.960 --> 00:13:33.790
Fireworks.

00:13:34.490 --> 00:13:35.660
Have you ever used them?

00:13:36.460 --> 00:13:39.110
Fireworks! I have!

00:13:39.300 --> 00:13:40.130
We're gonna use some now?

00:13:40.650 --> 00:13:41.140
Yep!

00:13:50.470 --> 00:13:53.140
Sparklers are so pretty!

00:13:55.400 --> 00:13:56.350
What're you doing?

00:13:56.940 --> 00:13:57.450
Look.

00:14:00.240 --> 00:14:02.860
Sparklers... how nostalgic.

00:14:03.660 --> 00:14:05.060
Don't they seem to get along well?

00:14:07.000 --> 00:14:07.810
It fell!

00:14:08.860 --> 00:14:09.790
It went out!

00:14:10.590 --> 00:14:11.380
They're more.

00:14:12.000 --> 00:14:12.570
Wanna use them?

00:14:13.000 --> 00:14:13.560
Yep!

00:14:14.090 --> 00:14:15.710
Why do you look so happy?

00:14:17.470 --> 00:14:19.340
Because... this sorta thing makes me happy.

00:14:19.900 --> 00:14:20.740
You're so weird.

00:14:22.230 --> 00:14:24.210
Oh, yeah. That's right...

00:14:25.410 --> 00:14:27.450
Mom... where's sis?

00:14:29.360 --> 00:14:31.640
Oh, Reiko? She said she was going on a trip, and suddenly left.

00:14:32.240 --> 00:14:33.070
A trip?

00:14:33.240 --> 00:14:33.800
Yes.

00:14:34.250 --> 00:14:36.690
She just sorta flew out.

00:15:00.040 --> 00:15:00.740
What's this?

00:15:02.900 --> 00:15:07.960
They're... the number of days I didn't cry.

00:15:10.340 --> 00:15:11.000
I...

00:15:12.740 --> 00:15:14.740
When my husband died...

00:15:17.830 --> 00:15:21.330
I didn't cry at all...

00:15:24.930 --> 00:15:28.200
But... when the funeral was over and we got back home...

00:15:29.290 --> 00:15:34.620
I thought, "My husband will never again return to this house."

00:15:36.740 --> 00:15:41.290
And then... I couldn't stop crying.

00:15:46.020 --> 00:15:54.090
The days passed and passed... and like something was broken, the tears kept on coming.

00:15:59.200 --> 00:16:00.470
Please!

00:16:04.000 --> 00:16:05.160
Poor thing...

00:16:05.650 --> 00:16:06.330
Yuzuyu...

00:16:07.240 --> 00:16:10.070
Until Mama comes back, be a good girl!

00:16:11.410 --> 00:16:12.280
Sorry.

00:16:48.970 --> 00:16:55.450
I must do my best to go back and get Yuzuyu without crying.

00:16:56.260 --> 00:16:57.060
So...

00:17:00.410 --> 00:17:03.430
You've counted the days you didn't cry.

00:17:04.580 --> 00:17:10.270
When I remember, even now, I start crying, but...

00:17:11.060 --> 00:17:14.960
But little by little, I'm able to stop...

00:17:16.350 --> 00:17:17.830
And... when I'm finally able to live without crying...

00:17:20.600 --> 00:17:23.090
At that time, for sure, I'll...

00:17:35.860 --> 00:17:37.720
It's okay, right?

00:17:37.910 --> 00:17:38.760
...The three of us together.

00:17:40.630 --> 00:17:42.630
Yay! How pretty!

00:17:45.460 --> 00:17:49.250
Well, if Yuzuyu-chan's with you, you can't do anything strange.

00:17:49.660 --> 00:17:51.030
What do you mean by "strange"?

00:17:51.410 --> 00:17:53.770
Touch your own chest and try asking again.

00:17:55.990 --> 00:17:57.520
I don't get it.

00:17:57.760 --> 00:18:00.240
I can't give permission if you don't.

00:18:00.580 --> 00:18:02.210
I understand! I'm sorry! Please give me permission!

00:18:06.530 --> 00:18:09.540
Okay. For Yuzuyu-chan's sake, I'll give you permission for today only.

00:18:17.760 --> 00:18:18.960
Kokoro-chin, come towards the center.

00:18:19.450 --> 00:18:20.640
Or else, you'll fall off.

00:18:23.360 --> 00:18:25.680
Sleeping together... This isn't an elementary student's sleepover.

00:18:26.250 --> 00:18:27.760
It's a bit tight!

00:18:29.350 --> 00:18:32.320
Why are you forcing the three of us to sleep together?

00:18:32.950 --> 00:18:34.580
It's love. Love.

00:18:35.560 --> 00:18:37.430
Sorry. I don't get it.

00:18:38.110 --> 00:18:40.510
It's like you're my papa and mama!

00:18:42.220 --> 00:18:42.900
Really?

00:18:45.440 --> 00:18:45.870
Yep!

00:18:48.770 --> 00:18:49.240
What?

00:18:51.120 --> 00:18:51.850
I'm happy.

00:18:54.670 --> 00:18:55.550
I feel like I'm gonna cry.

00:18:56.780 --> 00:18:58.520
You're like an old man lately!

00:19:09.730 --> 00:19:12.660
If I can live for a while without crying...

00:19:13.860 --> 00:19:15.860
If so... for sure, I'll...

00:19:21.240 --> 00:19:24.930
And then, Mr. Bear said, "Let's be friends!"

00:19:26.240 --> 00:19:32.240
But the sea was deep, and Mr. Bear couldn't get close to Mr. Bunny.

00:19:35.010 --> 00:19:38.750
So then, Mr. Bear decided to make a boat.

00:19:40.830 --> 00:19:41.400
She's asleep.

00:19:42.740 --> 00:19:43.270
Yep.

00:19:49.160 --> 00:19:51.340
Her sleeping smile... is cute.

00:19:51.720 --> 00:19:52.090
Yep.

00:19:52.860 --> 00:19:56.910
When I look at her like this, the stress from my day just goes away.

00:19:57.720 --> 00:20:00.140
Children sure are amazing.

00:20:02.460 --> 00:20:04.040
Kokoro-chin, come and stay over again sometime.

00:20:07.290 --> 00:20:09.350
Let's sleep together like this again, the three of us.

00:20:11.030 --> 00:20:11.490
Sure.

00:20:13.940 --> 00:20:15.190
Can we have a goodnight kiss?

00:20:16.020 --> 00:20:17.930
Weren't you not going to do anything?

00:20:18.670 --> 00:20:20.410
It's just a goodnight kiss!

00:20:20.940 --> 00:20:22.120
Then, just on the cheek.

00:20:24.740 --> 00:20:26.180
If you don't want to, then don't.

00:20:29.360 --> 00:20:30.310
I got it.

00:20:30.980 --> 00:20:31.610
Then, on the cheek!

00:20:42.120 --> 00:20:49.630
In the end, if someone's willing to stay with you, even without words - just staying with you - you can be happy.

00:20:50.980 --> 00:20:56.270
Even if you lose everything... If you look at all that's stopped around you, there will surely be someone looking your way.

00:21:03.060 --> 00:21:06.810
Don't be sad... Don't despair...

00:21:13.350 --> 00:21:14.380
Don't forget...

00:21:22.460 --> 00:21:23.990
You're not alone.

00:21:32.630 --> 00:21:33.430
I love you!

00:21:34.740 --> 00:21:36.030
I love you all!

00:23:35.790 --> 00:23:37.600
I'm... up!

00:23:37.760 --> 00:23:40.300
All right! It's perfect again today!

00:23:40.670 --> 00:23:42.310
Morning, Yuzuyu-chan!

00:23:42.750 --> 00:23:44.470
Morning, Onee-sama!

00:23:45.640 --> 00:23:47.810
If I can live for a while without crying...

00:23:48.620 --> 00:23:50.290
If so... for sure...I'll...

00:23:52.900 --> 00:23:55.600
Is there something on my face?

00:23:58.390 --> 00:23:59.520
No, there's nothing!

00:24:02.530 --> 00:24:06.550
Kippei! Yuzuyu-chan! You're gonna be late!

00:24:06.940 --> 00:24:08.910
Yuzuyu! Hurry!
